{"id":"wb-4-227","name":"圣索菲亚教堂","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"圣索菲亚教堂 (哈尔滨)","text":"圣索菲亚教堂（俄语：Софийский собор）位于中国黑龙江省哈尔滨市道里区兆麟街道，近中央大街，是远东地区最大的东正教教堂。教堂现已辟为哈尔滨建筑艺术馆，不再行使宗教功能。“圣索菲亚”词源为“神圣的智慧”。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9C%A3%E7%B4%A2%E8%8F%B2%E4%BA%9A%E6%95%99%E5%A0%82_(%E5%93%88%E5%B0%94%E6%BB%A8)","revisionId":92076197,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92076197","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f783bb7fe8a4863a195d5763.jpg","title":"West_facade_of_St._Sophia_Cathedral,_Harbin_(20230721150450).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:West_facade_of_St._Sophia_Cathedral,_Harbin_(20230721150450).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/42/West_facade_of_St._Sophia_Cathedral%2C_Harbin_%2820230721150450%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"N509FZ","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Entrance on the west side.","width":320,"height":213}}